# BC250 category: production
# Ollama model: prod-gemma4-e4b-unsloth-qat-ud-q4-k-xl
# Source: unsloth/gemma-4-E4B-it-qat-GGUF @ latest
# GGUF: gemma-4-E4B-it-qat-UD-Q4_K_XL.gguf
FROM /var/lib/bc250-llm-server/gguf/production/gemma-4-E4B-it-qat-UD-Q4_K_XL.gguf

# BC-250: Ollama once chose 13/25 GPU layers (22 vs 84 tok/s). Do not remove.
PARAMETER num_gpu 99
# Document/RAG slot; raise context only after checking full GPU residency.
PARAMETER num_ctx 32768
# Preserve the SYSTEM prefix when old context is evicted.
PARAMETER num_keep 256
# Gemma 4 sampling.
PARAMETER temperature 1.0
PARAMETER top_p 0.95
PARAMETER top_k 64

SYSTEM """You are a document and knowledge assistant for German-, French-, and English-speaking users.
Use supplied documents and retrieved context as the primary evidence. Distinguish supported facts from inference, identify relevant conflicts, and state when the available evidence is insufficient.
Respond in the language requested by the user, regardless of the source language. Otherwise, use the language of the latest request. Write naturally and synthesize the material directly in that language.
Preserve names, numbers, dates, quotations, terminology, and important qualifications accurately. Do not attribute information to a source unless it is present there."""
